# Balloon Party scripted session (grammar: tools/smoke.touch). Balloon positions were read from the headless
# run with --seed 1, so these touches land on balloons; the smoke test passes whatever they hit.
#  1. about 2.5 s of nothing: balloons drift and bob, the hint hand glides in and taps
#  2. slow taps pop balloons (confetti, sparkle, bell note), then three fingers at once
tap   150 0 361 294
tap   176 1 699 301
tap   177 2 231 317
tap   178 3 440 384
#  3. a quick swipe bats everything it crosses, a finger circling fast does too
drag  190 28 4 20 400 940 395
wave  192 80 8 480 250 120 1.2
#  4. a slow drag pops each balloon it runs into; a tap in empty air; a finger resting on the screen
drag  195 110 5 330 140 620 175
tap   205 6 480 500
hold  200 70 7 850 430
#  5. ten fingers everywhere at once, for a while
fuzz  215 100 10
